    "text": "Given, binary number $=1011001$ Its equivalent decimal number\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n=2^{\\circ}+0+0+2^{3}+2^{4}+2^{6} \\\\\r\n=1+8+16+64=89\r\n\\end{array}$",
